      "alt": "Starterkit STKa6x",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A9 based on i.MX6</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa6x is a purpose-built evaluation kit tailored for embedded computing engineers. It relies on the TQMa6x platform, driven by the Arm Cortex-A9 processor derived from the i.MX6 series by NXP. This kit shines in terms of security functions, supporting IEEE 1588 for precise time synchronization. It boasts NOR Flash and e-MMC Flash storage options, catering to diverse data storage needs. With a wide temperature range and low power consumption, typically around 4 watts, it ensures operational reliability even in challenging conditions. The integrated graphic controller excels at supporting high-resolution displays, making it a versatile choice for multimedia applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:46:28 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
